<title>THE LIST — fifteen domaines, Burgundy &amp; the Northern Rhône</title>
<style>
:root{--ink:#17130e;--mut:#6e6557;--faint:#a3988a;--rule:#e5ded0;--paper:#fbf9f5;--acc:#6d1f2c;--ok:#0a6b3d}
